  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "I am Mia. I am a kid. I am seven. I live in a house. I live with Mom and Dad. We are a happy family.",
      "Look at my face. It is in the mirror. I have one nose. I have one mouth. I have two eyes. I have two ears. Is it a nice face?",
      "Mom has a big smile. Dad has a big smile too. They are happy. I smile at Mom. I smile at Dad. Do you smile? I smile a lot. Smile, please!"
    ],
